(a) sections [1361](https://trello.com/c/YuWNPJzJ/77-1361-bribery "‌"), [1362](https://trello.com/c/QeBNfcbt/76-1362-unlawful-rewarding-of-public-servants "‌"), and [1366 ](https://trello.com/c/XVB5d0Sn/72-1366-threatening-public-servants "‌")when the official action or duty involved is as a federal public servant;

